Origin: DHI-internal (default image redirection)
Description: Redirect the operator's built-in fallback images for ValkeyCluster
 server and metrics-exporter sidecars from upstream Docker Hub to DHI images.
 These constants are only consulted when a ValkeyCluster CR leaves spec.image /
 spec.exporter.image unset; explicit CR overrides are unaffected either way.
 DefaultImage / DefaultExporterImage are replaced with literal ${VAR} tokens
 here; the build pipeline resolves them via envsubst using VALKEY_REFERENCE /
 REDIS_EXPORTER_REFERENCE (see .valkey-operator.inc.yaml) after this patch is
 applied, so the patch context stays stable across DHI image bumps.
Upstream reference: https://github.com/valkey-io/valkey-operator/blob/d46e70a523d941ff312952bb00bb3c542a4b61b5/internal/controller/valkeycluster_controller.go#L47-L52
Forwarded: not-needed (DHI build environment default-image redirection)

--- a/internal/controller/valkeycluster_controller.go
+++ b/internal/controller/valkeycluster_controller.go
@@ -47,8 +47,8 @@
 const (
 	DefaultPort           = 6379
 	DefaultClusterBusPort = 16379
-	DefaultImage          = "valkey/valkey:9.0.0"
-	DefaultExporterImage  = "oliver006/redis_exporter:v1.80.0"
+	DefaultImage          = "${VALKEY_REFERENCE}"
+	DefaultExporterImage  = "${REDIS_EXPORTER_REFERENCE}"
 	DefaultExporterPort   = 9121
 
 	// AclSecretType is the Secret type used for operator-managed ACL Secrets.
